spike of gate G3, 2026-11-11; the app since W12, 2026-11-12)

Source: https://github.com/termux/termux-app, tag v0.118.3
        (archive termux-app-v0.118.3.tar.gz, SHA-256
        5511ed1b9470be051181173d7571b6b66faea56c79a5fe7e2fc613cc432dd394)
Taken:  terminal-emulator/src/main/java, terminal-view/src/main/java and
        terminal-view/src/main/res, unchanged except as listed below.

